WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:36.530
<b>The Party's Off!!!</b>

3
00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:49.930
[laughs]

4
00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:52.560
[Luffy laughs]

5
00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:54.120
[Jinbe laughs]

6
00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:55.950
Really kept me waiting!

7
00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.900
[Carrot giggles]

8
00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:07.660
[ALL]
– Jimbei!
– Jimbei!

9
00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.160
[Jinbe laughs]

10
00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:14.120
Everyone! From this day forward,
I'm officially a Straw Hat!

11
00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:17.710
[Nami, Carrot, Chopper giggle]

12
00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:22.100
We were all
so worried about you!

13
00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.810
Missed you-teia!

14
00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.270
[CHOPPER]
The boss is back!

15
00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:28.050
[Jinbe laughs]
I'm relieved as well!

16
00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:30.800
Seems you've had
quite the struggle!

17
00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:37.120
It's wild we have a former
Warlord of the Sea on our crew!

18
00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.790
We're gonna kick so much ass!

19
00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:43.440
[Brook chuckles]
I'm so glad he's all right!

20
00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:46.070
[gasps]

21
00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:50.880
Nami! Could you please tone down
the intimacy of that hug?!

22
00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:59.010
I was really worried
about you, man.

23
00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:00.350
You took a while!

24
00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:02.640
My apologies!

25
00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.650
Some of Sun Pirates
were wounded,

26
00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:06.730
so I had to tend to them first.

27
00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:10.360
Then they threw me a big
send-off for old times' sake!

28
00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:12.610
Forgive me, Captain.

29
00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:14.500
[chuckles]

30
00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.450
But you know how it is!

31
00:03:12.970 --> 00:03:14.540
[All chuckle]

32
00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.420
Everyone. Thank you
for having me!

33
00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:21.880
And once again,
I shall do my best!

34
00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:27.300
You won't believe this
guy's steering skills!

35
00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.220
Jinbe! You gotta show off!

36
00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:32.360
He even used the Sunny
like a big surfboard!

37
00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:35.690
Freakin' sweet. It's about time!

38
00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:33.850
[giggles]

39
00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.030
We finally got a guy who can

40
00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:39.570
make full use of
the Ship of Dreams.

41
00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:39.820
Let's do this!

42
00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.400
All right.
Time for a toast, right?

43
00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:44.820
yeah!

44
00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.760
Now let's drink!

45
00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.970
[ALL]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

46
00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.550
Hold up a second.

47
00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:53.180
We don't have any alcohol
on hand though.

48
00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:57.890
[ZORO]
Wrong. I can smell
some booze in the air.

49
00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.450
Then where the hell is it?

50
00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:01.050
in front of it?

51
00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:08.730
Hey! Sir Luffy!

52
00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:10.270
If you have a moment,

53
00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.860
I would like to discuss
our next course of action

54
00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:14.730
once we reach the island!

55
00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:15.940
You hear me?

56
00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:20.280
Please make your way
over to us! Sir Luffy?

57
00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.610
You're lying your ass off.

58
00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.450
All I can smell is the ocean!

59
00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.410
I am not a liar!

60
00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.580
[gasps]
I smell food
over that way!

61
00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.290
Please, Sir Luffy!

62
00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.620
Give it up.

63
00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.420
There's no point in
trying to reason with them.

64
00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:37.760
They're not gonna listen to you.

65
00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:41.920
Besides, you bums
are on my ship.

66
00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.970
If you want to talk strategy,
take it elsewhere.

67
00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:54.480
[Shishilian yells]

68
00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.860
Please excuse my tardiness!

69
00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:59.650
I wish to be briefed
on your strategy!

70
00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:04.280
<b>"Full-Power" Shishilian

Commander of Inuarashi's Musketeers</b>

71
00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.700
Oho! Sir "Full-Power"
Shishilian!

72
00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.370
Duke Dogstorm,
I know that you-gara

73
00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:12.620
will be fighting as a retainer
for the Kozuki Clan.

74
00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:16.040
Therefore, allow me to lead the
Mink forces in your stead, sir!

75
00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.500
Splendid. Thank you-gara.

76
00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.170
[HYOGORO]
Allow me as well.

77
00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.340
[Kin'emon gasps]

78
00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.970
It would be my humble
honor to assist you!

79
00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:27.140
I will take command
over the samurai!

80
00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:30.140
<b>Hyogoro "the Flower"

Former Big Boss of Wano's Underground</b>

81
00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:34.060
Boss Hyogoro, it's you!

82
00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.150
You must forgive
my lengthy disappearance.

83
00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:37.980
I know that you have suffered.

84
00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:38.720
I am delighted to
see you as well.

85
00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:40.600
Now, before we
reach our destination,

86
00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:43.600
let's work out the details
of our plan, shall we?

87
00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:45.100
I trust you have
everything in order?

88
00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:45.270
[KIN'EMON]
Of course.

89
00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:46.770
Those bastards.

90
00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:50.360
Look at them, making themselves
right at home on my deck!

91
00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.410
Gentlemen!

92
00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.330
I only have time to
explain this plan once!

93
00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.290
So heed well!

94
00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.250
Let's take a glance at the map.

95
00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:04.390
<b>Onigashima</b>

96
00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.550
[KIN'EMON]
Even if you attempt
to proceed by boat,

97
00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.470
the steep mountainside
will bar your way!

98
00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:10.890
It's impenetrable!

99
00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:14.430
There is but a single entrance
to the entire island!

100
00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.510
And that would be
through the front gate!

101
00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:17.190
Onigashima is a remote island
surrounded by mountains.

102
00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:19.190
The giant skull is
a rock formation,

103
00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.360
surrounded by mountains,

104
00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.860
with Kaido's castle
hidden inside.

105
00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:25.530
Referencing the blueprints
that we had stolen,

106
00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.030
there is a rear entrance

107
00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.950
located on the opposite
side of the island.

108
00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:29.740
<b>Back Door</b>

109
00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.240
Understand?

110
00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.450
Our best bet is to avoid

111
00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.910
the heavily-guarded
front gate entirely.

112
00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:40.380
<b>Back Door</b>

113
00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.460
Therefore we shall separate
into two groups,

114
00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:39.540
take the mountain paths
to the left and right,

115
00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.540
then infiltrate from behind!

116
00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.630
Kaido will be intoxicated
after the festivities,

117
00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:45.920
so we'll make it quick!

118
00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.670
It'll be a surprise attack!

119
00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.760
We cannot fail!

120
00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:55.860
That was the decoy plan you said

121
00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:58.450
in Kanjuro's presence
to deceive him, right?

122
00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:00.950
Though the details are
a bit hastily crafted,

123
00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:04.700
it will surely serve its purpose
and throw off the enemy.

124
00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:05.830
Decoy?

125
00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:08.660
Now. What is the real strategy?

126
00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:11.880
[Kin'emon gasps]

127
00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:14.230
[RAIZO]
He's over-evaluating again.

128
00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:18.530
Firstly. We have to assume
the enemy is aware of the raid.

129
00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:19.740
And they'll actively seek out

130
00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:22.860
the Akazaya Samurai
before anyone else.

131
00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:27.580
They'll also be looking for me.

132
00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:28.830
And since we're all captains,

133
00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:32.620
that goes for Straw Hat
and Eustass as well.

134
00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:34.670
Indeed! That is true!

135
00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:34.760
[LAW]
Honestly, it won't matter

136
00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:35.800
[LAW]
Honestly, it won't
matter what kinda plan

137
00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:36.470
what kind of plan
you slap together.

138
00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.960
you slap together.

139
00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:40.640
We're dealing with two
Grade A idiots as allies.

140
00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.470
They'll charge straight in
no matter what.

141
00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:46.060
[Both yelling] [Both yell]

142
00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:50.860
<b>Idiots</b>

143
00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.730
[LAW]
But if we use them as decoys,

144
00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.770
we can salvage the operation.

145
00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:52.100
Lucky for us,
they can hold their own.

146
00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:57.620
<b>Idiots</b>

147
00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:53.900
Once Kaido finds out
he's been invaded,

148
00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:55.520
he's going to send out
everything he's got

149
00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.820
to stop those two dumbasses.

150
00:07:57.820 --> 00:07:59.400
I understand now!

151
00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.240
So when our pirate
friends undoubtedly

152
00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:02.860
run straight for the entrance,

153
00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:05.870
the guards will leave the rest
of the palace relatively clear.

154
00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:10.720
<b>Idiots</b>

155
00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:07.700
[LAW]
Right.
We'll use that opportunity

156
00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:11.040
to proceed down the
side paths as planned.

157
00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:15.840
However, that too is a diversion
to protect the samurai.

158
00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:19.670
[HYOGORO]
Mm. We're prepared for anything,

159
00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:22.220
even if we need to
sacrifice ourselves.

160
00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:25.720
The Akazaya Samurai must make it
to the battle against Kaido.

161
00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:27.390
That's the only thing
that matters.

162
00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:30.430
I agree! But how will
you-gara get them inside?

163
00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:32.140
They'll go by water.

164
00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:33.310
[gasps]

165
00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:34.480
Forgetting a detail?

166
00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:36.650
Won't the whirlpools
be an issue for us?

167
00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:38.190
That part's already covered.

168
00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:40.480
There's no need to worry.

169
00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:43.860
We're going to use the
Polar Tang, my submarine.

170
00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:45.700
By taking it around
the back of the island,

171
00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:49.280
we'll avoid the
whirlpools altogether.

172
00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:51.080
Then, I'm up.

173
00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:55.790
[LAW]
I'll use my Room ability
to send you all onto the island.

174
00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:00.840
Sir Law! Thank you!

175
00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:02.510
But there's one concern.

176
00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:04.050
I feel that at the very least,

177
00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:06.180
I must be there
to lead of the troops.

178
00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.930
You have a point.

179
00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:10.100
Then we should send
one of us on each path.

180
00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.850
I will take the one side
of the mountain

181
00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:13.890
and you can take the other.

182
00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:15.190
What say you?

183
00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:18.020
Raizo? Kawamatsu? Dogstorm?

184
00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:20.610
Kikunojo? Ashura?

185
00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:22.230
I agree.

186
00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:25.110
In the meantime, the rest of us
will all stick together.

187
00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:26.910
We'll make sure to
save our full strength

188
00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.620
for the fight against Kaido!

189
00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:32.280
Very good! Just as I planned it.

190
00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:34.370
We'll go with this strategy!

191
00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:37.880
Very clever, Kin!
Incredible plan!

192
00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:39.170
[RAIZO]
Yeah.

193
00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.590
[DENJIRO]
See the torii gate here?

194
00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:49.430
That's the first
hindrance we'll face

195
00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:51.180
when we enter Onigashima.

196
00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:54.390
How serious is this?
Are there guards involved?

197
00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:56.390
Yes, and that isn't all.

198
00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:57.810
It serves as both an entrance

199
00:09:57.810 --> 00:10:00.480
and a small armed
fortress for Kaido.

200
00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:05.700
They should have plenty
of cannons to fire at us.

201
00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:08.490
Keep in mind,
today is the Fire Festival.

202
00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:12.080
More Beast Pirates than usual
will be waiting on Onigashima.

203
00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:14.290
I see. So proceed cautiously.

204
00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:16.750
We don't know how many
of them are expecting us.

205
00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.160
I suggest we stick together.

206
00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:20.000
That way, if we're found,
we still have a chance.

207
00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.380
This sound risky.

208
00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.800
No matter the case.

209
00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.670
We must inform our allies
of this at once!

210
00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.150
[Raizo, Kin'emon scream]

211
00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:35.030
[LAW]
Hey. Where in the hell
did the Straw Hat's boat go?

212
00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.460
[Kin'emon, Raizo scream]

213
00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:39.030
[KIN'EMON]
Oh, no! Sir Luffy!

214
00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:41.470
Please don't tell me
that was them!

215
00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:43.840
Quickly, Sir Law!
Send your vessel that way!

216
00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.930
They must be in dire
need of assistance!

217
00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:01.610
Don't let 'em get any closer!

218
00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:03.440
Fire! Blast them away!

219
00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:05.990
Take this!

220
00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:07.720
Gum-Gum Gatling!

221
00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:11.340
All right! Now, Gum-Gum...

222
00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:14.430
[Kin'emon gasps]
Up there!

223
00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:24.050
[Beast Pirate D gasps]

224
00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:27.010
Gum-Gum Pistol!

225
00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:29.140
It's over for you!

226
00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:31.760
[yells]

227
00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:38.160
Red Hawk!

228
00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:40.350
<b>Gum-Gum Pistol</b>

229
00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.400
Two-Sword Style.

230
00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.940
[Beast Pirates gasp]

231
00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:56.620
Now, Hawk Wave!

232
00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.460
[Beast Pirates scream]

233
00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:09.920
<b>Two-Sword Style:

Hawk Surge</b>

234
00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:12.050
[Beast Pirates yell]

235
00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:15.010
[chuckles]
It seems
you have me surrounded.

236
00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:16.510
Time to take him out!

237
00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:21.810
Now, Soul Solid!

238
00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:36.030
Swallow Banderole!

239
00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:45.740
<b>Soul Solid: Swallow Banderole</b>

240
00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:49.960
Now Mil Fleurs!
Gigantesco Mano!

241
00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:57.320
[Luffy laughs]
It's party time!

242
00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.930
And Stomp!

243
00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:06.600
[Beast Pirates gasping]

244
00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:13.070
[Beast Pirates screaming]

245
00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:13.980
<b>Mil Fleur, Gigantesco Mano:

Stomp</b>

246
00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:15.640
[ZORO]
Huh?

247
00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:24.350
My sweet Robin.

248
00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:25.810
[BEAST PIRATE H]
Hey, suit guy!

249
00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:28.520
Think ya can just light
a cigarette mid fight?

250
00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:33.110
[Beast Pirate H yells]

251
00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:34.650
Flanchet.

252
00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:36.820
The Straw Hats are
extremely tough.

253
00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:38.210
<b>Flanchet</b>

254
00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:46.580
Franky Boxing!

255
00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:48.870
Super!

256
00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:50.430
<b>Franky Boxing</b>

257
00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:56.630
I think they're doing just fine
without our help, agreed?

258
00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:01.260
[Samurai C, Samurai D gasp]

259
00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:04.060
Bravo, Sir Luffy!

260
00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:06.980
All right! Decent fighting, men!

261
00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:08.020
It was all right.

262
00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:09.190
Yes, acceptable!

263
00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:11.230
[ALL]
Good job, troops!
Adequate work!

264
00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:14.210
Why'd you guys just
wait on the sidelines, huh?

265
00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:18.900
[DENJIRO]
The torii gate guards.
They were all knocked out.

266
00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.610
Oh, wow. That's a
lot of weapons.

267
00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:23.190
Imagine if we'd fought them.

268
00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:25.280
Uh-huh. Our number of troops

269
00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:28.200
would have dwindled
down for sure.

270
00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.780
Then that means we can
all sail forth together.

271
00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:35.450
[Samurai C, Samurai D gasp]

272
00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:38.920
[KOJURO]
To Onigashima!

273
00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:40.890
[BOTH]
Huh?

274
00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:52.020
[Beast Pirates gasping]

275
00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:53.150
[Beast Pirate F gasps]

276
00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:54.690
Damn you!

277
00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:57.530
Hey, jackass, you need a giant
sippy cup or something?

278
00:14:57.530 --> 00:15:02.450
That was a ton of good
alcohol you just wasted!

279
00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:04.950
[laughs]

280
00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.620
[Beast Pirate H gasps]

281
00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:14.250
[Both giggle]

282
00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:16.090
[WOMEN]
– Oh, Lord Orochi!
– Oh, Lord Orochi!

283
00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:17.420
You'll never catch up to...

284
00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:19.050
[WOMEN]
...me!

285
00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:22.760
I won't? Well,
here I come, my pretties!

286
00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:25.980
[Orochi laughing]

287
00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:30.600
Seems like someone's
in a good mood today.

288
00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:33.110
I like it when you're happy,
Mister Shogun.

289
00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.440
It's adorable!

290
00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:36.740
I bet something really
nice happened to you!

291
00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:39.990
What clever girls you all are!
How did you know?

292
00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:42.080
[WOMAN D]
Oh boy! Tell us!

293
00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.450
Well, it's a most splendid day!

294
00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:45.790
There was some trash in my way

295
00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.710
and it's finally been
disposed of, you see!

296
00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:53.630
Now, that garbage is finally
in the ground where it belongs.

297
00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:55.050
So you're extra happy today

298
00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:57.090
because somebody
took the garbage out?

299
00:15:57.090 --> 00:15:59.760
The shogun is such
a weirdo sometimes!

300
00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:01.340
[Women giggle]

301
00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:06.210
[Orochi laughs]
Do you lovely
ladies really find it that odd?

302
00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:06.350
[WOMAN E]
Obviously!

303
00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:08.560
[WOMAN F]
But it's cute in a quirky way!

304
00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:09.680
[WOMEN]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

305
00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:14.060
[Orochi giggles]
As the Shogun of Wano,

306
00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:17.650
I declare that it is now
a law to come to daddy!

307
00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:23.820
Which of you dares
to defy my orders?

308
00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:24.190
Where the hell is my oshiruko?

309
00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:25.440
[QUEEN]
You!

310
00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:28.500
Apologies for the delay, sir!

311
00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.790
We'll bring it to
you right after

312
00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.460
we deliver Big Mom's order!

313
00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.830
[QUEEN]
Big Mom?

314
00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:35.710
Why does she get
to skip the line?

315
00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.000
Did you forget there's gonna be

316
00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.260
a performance for
the banquet tonight?

317
00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.550
I'm a little foggy here,

318
00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:42.930
why don't you remind me
who's the star?

319
00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:46.140
The man's name is right
on the tip of my tongue.

320
00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:47.930
[BEAST PIRATES]
Queen!

321
00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:50.100
Yeah! Damn right it's me!

322
00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:53.310
And which Lead Performer's
got the pipes and the talent?

323
00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:54.560
[BEAST PIRATES]
Queen!

324
00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:57.520
[QUEEN]
That's for sure!
Can you dig it? Ha!

325
00:16:57.520 --> 00:17:00.940
So feed me! I can't lose
any more weight!

326
00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:03.070
The ladies will go crazy.

327
00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:06.020
[Beast Pirates cheer]

328
00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:07.080
You prisoners wipe that
stupid grin off your face!

329
00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:10.500
Wipe that stupid grin
off your face and get moving!

330
00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.950
[KAIDO]
The party's in full swing,

331
00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.730
and everyone's having
a great time.

332
00:17:14.730 --> 00:17:17.020
Agreed! And I'm really
looking forward to

333
00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:18.820
the big show tonight, sir!

334
00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:20.650
[KAIDO]
Do we know if he's joining us?

335
00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:21.650
Who?

336
00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:26.080
[KAIDO]
He needs to be there!
It's the banquet!

337
00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:28.290
I-I'll find him, sir!

338
00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:29.710
Commander!

339
00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:32.540
All six members of the
Tobi Roppo have just arrived!

340
00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:33.960
Are you ready?

341
00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:34.810
They're here to see me?

342
00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:38.440
But either way, I might as well
introduce them to Linlin.

343
00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:40.820
Where the hell is
the old bag, anyway?

344
00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:42.900
[BEAST PIRATE M]
It's not a good time, sir.

345
00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:45.860
Big Mom is changing into
her kimono at this moment.

346
00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:47.450
[KAIDO]
What?

347
00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:48.780
[BEAST PIRATE N]
Commander Kaido!

348
00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:51.240
The Tobi Roppo are outside!

349
00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:41.730
<b>GOLDEN FESTIVAL</b>

350
00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:54.860
[Beast Pirates cheering]

351
00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.110
♪ The Brachio that tiptoes,
like a mofo! ♪

352
00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:07.040
♪ No need to be vague,
ya know him as "The Plague"! ♪

353
00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:11.000
♪ Comin' to ya
in wide screen! ♪

354
00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:16.790
[Beast Pirates cheering]

355
00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:19.840
[APOO]
It's Queen!

356
00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:23.140
[Beast Pirate A screams]

357
00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:26.680
I keep ya waiting?

358
00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.800
Give it up! Give it up!

359
00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:29.980
You ready to kick off
the Golden Festival?

360
00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:32.730
It's time to party!

361
00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:40.970
♪ Zoomin', zoomin',
zoomin', zoomin' ♪

362
00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:39.360
♪ Zoomin', zoomin',
zoomin', zoomin'. ♪

363
00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:41.230
♪ Zoomin', zoomin',
zoomin', zoomin'. ♪

364
00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:44.970
♪ Zoomin', zoomin',
zoomin', zoomin' ♪

365
00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:43.070
♪ Zoomin', zoomin',
zoomin', zoomin'. ♪

366
00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:46.560
♪ Not gonna lose no weight. ♪

367
00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:45.240
[QUEEN]
♪ Not gonna lose no weight. ♪

368
00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:48.640
♪ Just more to appreciate. ♪

369
00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:52.740
♪ I got enough fans
attracted to my funk! ♪

370
00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:55.770
[Beast Pirates cheering]

371
00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:59.740
♪ Zoomin', zoomin',
zoomin', zoomin'. ♪

372
00:19:59.740 --> 00:19:59.790
♪ I look round as a ball ♪

373
00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:01.240
♪ I look round as a ball, but
all of this is muscle, y'all. ♪

374
00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:03.670
♪ but all of this
is muscle, y'all. ♪

375
00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:06.260
♪ These bomb-ass moves of
mine are powered by my... ♪

376
00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:11.930
[Beast Pirates screaming]

377
00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:14.260
Lemme hear you scream!

378
00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:17.560
Now you know how this goes.

379
00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:20.980
Imma do a little
roll call, y'all!

380
00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:23.270
Now make some noise!

381
00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:27.240
♪ It's your time,
not a moment later! ♪

382
00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:29.170
♪ Whatcha say, are ya sick
of waiting, Waiters? ♪

383
00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:31.290
♪ Ya down in the dumps,
but laughter's your treasure! ♪

384
00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:35.210
♪ Come on, laugh it up,
Pleasures! ♪

385
00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:39.040
[Pleasures laugh]

386
00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:42.790
♪ Blessed with the gift
of Smiles and clout! ♪

387
00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.800
♪ Gifters, let it all out! ♪

388
00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:48.550
[Gifters yell]

389
00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:50.510
♪ The Headliners know they're
the cream of the crop! ♪

390
00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:52.550
♪ Let me hear you call out
from the top! ♪

391
00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:54.680
[Headliners yell]

392
00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.060
<b>Headliners</b>

393
00:20:56.260 --> 00:20:58.270
♪ Last but not least,
top six at the feast! ♪

394
00:20:58.270 --> 00:20:59.980
♪ Strong and dangerous
like my flow, ♪

395
00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:04.360
♪ give it up y'all for
the Tobi Roppo! ♪

396
00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:14.670
Those pretentious asses
never respond!

397
00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:19.840
Now where are my monsters at?

398
00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:22.140
Numbers, go!

399
00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.470
[Jaki roars]

400
00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:29.520
[Beast Pirates laugh]

401
00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:31.230
You hearing this shitshow?

402
00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:32.480
Eh, what do I care.

403
00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:33.440
[Beast Pirates laugh]

404
00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:34.820
Orochi's forces, pick it up!

405
00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:37.440
Gonna need the Mimawari-gumi
to raise the roof!

406
00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:38.940
[Beast Pirates cheer]

407
00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:40.740
[QUEEN]
Now the Oniwabanshu!

408
00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.080
[Beast Pirates yell]

409
00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:43.660
But wait, there's more!

410
00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:45.700
I hear we have some
special guests tonight.

411
00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:48.210
Y'all ready for
a family reunion?

412
00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:49.420
[BEAST PIRATES]
Huh?

413
00:21:49.420 --> 00:21:51.840
[QUEEN]
Big Mom's kids are on their way!

414
00:21:51.840 --> 00:21:54.420
[Beast Pirates gasp]

415
00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:58.800
[Ulti sighs]
Queen won't
shut his big fat face.

416
00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:01.470
Did you hear him
call us a buncha asses?

417
00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:03.220
He's ever-ever so awful!

418
00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:05.430
[PAGE ONE]
So is that your new thing now?

419
00:22:05.430 --> 00:22:07.890
Trying to sound like
a fancy lady?

420
00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:09.190
Give it up. It's embarrassing.

421
00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:11.980
[ULTI]
Aww, don't be
such a booger, Pay-Pay!

422
00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:16.200
It's ever-ever so lame!

423
00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:19.860
Suppose old Queen happened
to drop dead tonight.

424
00:22:19.860 --> 00:22:22.660
There'd be a Lead
Performer vacancy.

425
00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:24.120
Who would it go to?

426
00:22:24.120 --> 00:22:25.700
Answer him, Drake.

427
00:22:25.700 --> 00:22:27.870
You think you're
the most qualified, right?

428
00:22:29.300 --> 00:22:29.500
Huh?

429
00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:31.960
[DRAKE]
I'm not interested in
becoming a Lead Performer.

430
00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:34.420
<b>X. Drake</b>

431
00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:33.130
Don't be stupid.

432
00:22:33.130 --> 00:22:35.000
[SASAKI]
Oh, you dropping
out of the race?

433
00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:39.250
<b>Sasaki</b>

434
00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:37.340
'Cause that would
work out perfectly for me.

435
00:22:37.340 --> 00:22:39.010
Much obliged.

436
00:22:39.010 --> 00:22:42.010
And what about you, Pay-Pay?
You passing, too?

437
00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:41.920
<b>Sasaki</b>

438
00:22:42.010 --> 00:22:43.220
[PAGE ONE]
Huh?

439
00:22:42.300 --> 00:22:49.720
<b>Page One</b>

440
00:22:43.220 --> 00:22:44.800
[SASAKI]
I don't think you got the chops

441
00:22:44.800 --> 00:22:49.520
since you let Soba Mask get away
without so much as a scratch.

442
00:22:49.520 --> 00:22:50.940
[ULTI]
You take that back!

443
00:22:50.940 --> 00:22:53.650
If you insult my sweet
Pay-Pay one more time,

444
00:22:53.230 --> 00:22:55.730
<b>Ulti</b>

445
00:22:53.650 --> 00:22:55.610
I'll snap you
like a twig, Sasaki!

446
00:22:55.610 --> 00:22:57.530
[PAGE ONE]
Just stop it, Sis. It's fine.

447
00:22:57.530 --> 00:22:59.150
[ULTI]
You don't get to boss me around!

448
00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:00.530
[PAGE ONE]
Calm down.

449
00:23:00.530 --> 00:23:03.200
[ULTI]
You think you can
tell me what to do, huh?

450
00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:08.830
<b>Who's-Who</b>

451
00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:06.370
Hey, that's enough
screeching, you damn brats.

452
00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:08.500
[BLACK MARIA]
I find their
antics rather charming.

453
00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:09.740
<b>Who's-Who</b>

454
00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:12.660
I love it when Ully
throws a tantrum.

455
00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:14.750
<b>Black Maria</b>

456
00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:14.620
She's out for blood.

457
00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:17.950
[sighs]
So are we
just waiting around

458
00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:19.950
or did they call us here
for a reason?

459
00:23:19.950 --> 00:23:21.620
The usual, I'm sure.

460
00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:23.330
We were told it was urgent.

461
00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:25.080
Kaido's orders.

462
00:23:25.080 --> 00:23:28.000
Take a guess what he wants.

463
00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:30.340
[ULTI]
So, it's dysfunctional
family junk again?

464
00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:35.300
[All gasp]

465
00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:37.650
<b>The Soaring Six
Beast Pirates</b>

466
00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:39.300
[ULTI]
Is Kaido stupid or something?

467
00:23:39.300 --> 00:23:42.470
[ALL]
– Don't trash-talk the Commander, idiot!
– Don't trash-talk the Commander, idiot!

468
00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:44.590
[laughs]

469
00:23:47.100 --> 00:23:49.480
[LUFFY]
Kin'emon! Over here!

470
00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:52.110
We beat up some guys! [laughs]

471
00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:57.650
[sighs]
I was hoping
we'd have more leeway.

472
00:23:57.650 --> 00:23:58.860
[SANJI]
Yo, Moss-head!

473
00:23:58.860 --> 00:24:00.070
Huh?

474
00:24:00.070 --> 00:24:01.410
[SANJI]
Where the hell
did that come from?

475
00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:05.520
Didn't I tell ya?
I know that smell anywhere.

476
00:24:05.520 --> 00:24:06.990
[USOPP]
He's like an animal.

477
00:24:06.990 --> 00:24:09.040
Hey! It's ready!

478
00:24:09.040 --> 00:24:11.460
Come on, you guys! Hurry up!

479
00:24:11.460 --> 00:24:16.540
Coming! [chuckles]
We've got a toast to make!

480
00:24:16.540 --> 00:24:18.460
[NAMI]
Luffy! Come on,
we're gonna drink it all

481
00:24:18.460 --> 00:24:19.960
before you get here!

482
00:24:19.960 --> 00:24:21.260
Or Zoro will.

483
00:24:21.260 --> 00:24:23.130
[Zoro gasps]
No, I won't!

484
00:24:23.130 --> 00:24:24.930
[LUFFY]
I'm on my way!

485
00:24:24.930 --> 00:24:27.390
Here's one for you, Boss.

486
00:24:27.390 --> 00:24:29.060
Thank you, kindly.

487
00:24:29.060 --> 00:24:30.480
Raise a toast to Jinbe,

488
00:24:30.480 --> 00:24:33.520
the super helmsman
we've all been waiting for!

489
00:24:33.520 --> 00:24:36.820
Aww, if we had some more time,
I'd break out a song!

490
00:24:36.820 --> 00:24:38.150
[Brook laughs]

491
00:24:37.560 --> 00:24:39.440
[Usopp chuckles]

492
00:24:39.440 --> 00:24:41.320
[laughs]
You know,
exchanging saké cups

493
00:24:41.320 --> 00:24:43.390
is usually a more solemn affair!

494
00:24:43.390 --> 00:24:44.440
[LUFFY]
All right!

495
00:24:44.440 --> 00:24:46.520
Get your cups
ready, guys! Cheers!

496
00:24:46.520 --> 00:24:48.020
[ALL]
– Cheers!
– Cheers!

497
00:24:49.940 --> 00:24:52.610
♪ Jinbe! ♪

498
00:24:53.610 --> 00:24:58.240
♪ We're so glad you
came back our way! ♪

499
00:24:58.240 --> 00:25:01.200
Thank you for your
assistance, Sir Luffy!

500
00:25:01.200 --> 00:25:03.440
You have cleared
our first obstacle for us!

501
00:25:04.670 --> 00:25:08.000
And now, we go forth!

502
00:25:08.000 --> 00:25:09.300
[gasps]

503
00:25:12.300 --> 00:25:16.050
[gasps]

504
00:25:16.050 --> 00:25:18.430
You see that?
Since when are they so excited?

505
00:25:18.430 --> 00:25:20.930
If I had to guess,
seeing that fortress dismantled

506
00:25:20.930 --> 00:25:23.060
must have boosted
everyone's morale.

507
00:25:23.060 --> 00:25:24.600
Once we get to Onigashima,

508
00:25:24.600 --> 00:25:26.310
I bet they're really
gonna let loose!

509
00:25:26.310 --> 00:25:28.400
Then hurry up and
finish the toast already!

510
00:25:28.400 --> 00:25:31.690
We gotta get moving
so we can back them up!

511
00:25:35.070 --> 00:25:38.120
We must not let this
opportunity go to waste.

512
00:25:38.120 --> 00:25:39.950
Let's keep up the momentum.

513
00:25:39.950 --> 00:25:43.120
Right! Our foes will
never see us coming.

514
00:25:43.120 --> 00:25:44.790
How lucky we are.

515
00:25:44.790 --> 00:25:46.750
The Straw Hats
are quite an asset!

516
00:25:46.750 --> 00:25:47.920
They are!

517
00:25:47.920 --> 00:25:50.880
My despair has been
washed away at last.

518
00:25:49.140 --> 00:25:50.440
[gasps]

519
00:25:50.920 --> 00:25:56.090
Now, we're carried on the waves
of hope that they bring.

520
00:25:56.090 --> 00:25:58.260
To arms, loyal samurai!

521
00:25:58.260 --> 00:25:58.440
Take a stand
as a Kozuki warrior!

522
00:25:58.440 --> 00:26:00.800
Take a stand as
a Kozuki warrior!

523
00:26:00.800 --> 00:26:02.810
We shall lead you!

524
00:26:02.810 --> 00:26:06.700
All ships, to Onigashima!

525
00:26:11.940 --> 00:26:14.040
Our moment is now!

526
00:26:14.040 --> 00:26:19.240
[All yell]

527
00:26:33.130 --> 00:26:35.380
What's going on with you?

528
00:26:37.590 --> 00:26:39.010
[ZORO]
Luffy?

529
00:26:39.010 --> 00:26:40.470
Why are you being so weird?

530
00:26:40.470 --> 00:26:43.010
[LUFFY]
Drop the drinks.

531
00:26:43.010 --> 00:26:44.600
Save it for the samurai.

532
00:26:44.600 --> 00:26:45.770
[Usopp, Nami gasp]

533
00:26:45.770 --> 00:26:47.680
[LUFFY]
The feast,
the toast, everything!

534
00:26:47.680 --> 00:26:49.440
[chuckles]

535
00:26:49.440 --> 00:26:51.690
[LUFFY]
Let's do it after we beat Kaido!

536
00:26:51.690 --> 00:26:53.150
[Sanji chuckles]

537
00:26:53.150 --> 00:26:56.320
[LUFFY]
And we'll kick Orochi
and Big Mom's asses, too!

538
00:26:56.320 --> 00:26:58.900
After all this is over,

539
00:26:58.900 --> 00:27:02.620
we can have the biggest,
best party ever!

540
00:27:02.620 --> 00:27:05.290
Let's go win this thing!

541
00:27:09.040 --> 00:27:10.290
You know,
you're the one who wanted

542
00:27:10.290 --> 00:27:12.170
to stop and have
the stupid toast.

543
00:27:12.170 --> 00:27:14.170
But sure, change our
plans last second!

544
00:27:14.170 --> 00:27:16.260
[SANJI]
That's right,
you tell him, Nami!

545
00:27:16.260 --> 00:27:17.380
[LUFFY]
Tell me what?

546
00:27:17.380 --> 00:27:18.920
I don't see why you guys
are surprised.

547
00:27:18.920 --> 00:27:20.180
He does what he wants,

548
00:27:20.180 --> 00:27:21.760
there's no point in us
complaining about it.

549
00:27:23.180 --> 00:27:25.220
[ZORO, SANJI, USOPP]
– Hey, why are you nodding, too?
– Hey, why are you nodding, too?

550
00:27:25.220 --> 00:27:27.430
[ROBIN]
It seems that
the captain has spoken,

551
00:27:27.430 --> 00:27:32.940
but how do you feel about
delaying the party, Boss?

552
00:27:32.940 --> 00:27:37.570
I'm pretty sure you
already know my answer!

553
00:27:37.570 --> 00:27:40.490
[ALL]
– We're in!
– We're in!

554
00:27:44.330 --> 00:27:46.120
[chuckles]

555
00:27:46.120 --> 00:27:49.250
[LUFFY]
All right!
Let's get a move on!

556
00:27:49.250 --> 00:27:51.580
Follow those samurai!

557
00:27:51.580 --> 00:27:54.540
[ALL]
– Aye-aye, Captain!
– Aye-aye, Captain!
